# image). Keep the context lean and secret-free.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
.git/
apps/frontend/
docs/
infra/
**/*.sqlite
apps/backend/benchmark/out/
apps/backend/tests/
